## Recorded authority

Recorded 2026-11-27T11:47Z from the author’s interface /root; truthful relay, not an
author signature. Author authorized raid through review/gates/merge/roar.

Child of1572: broader author intent, distinct from footnote applicability.
Actual author reply as relayed by /root:

> oui. Et de manière générale, tenir à la fois la reproduction computationnelle (implémentation, spécification) et la reproduction scientifique (argumentation, modèle, faits)

Hold both computational reproduction (implementation/specification) and
scientific reproduction (argument/model/facts) in view. Numeric agreement
cannot certify the scientific argument; scientific plausibility cannot erase
a computational miss. No automatic composite ACRe score, autonomous scientific
signoff, or every-conceivable-audit mandate. Scientific reproduction cannot be
reduced to causal DAGs: noncausal models/meta-analysis remain in generic scope.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] An actual distinct route advisor informs bounded design before implementation, with report/disagreement and observed-or-masked identity evidence retained.
- [ ] Design integrates identification appraisal, text/code anomalies, source facts, and argument/model consistency without a DAG-only reduction or exhaustive-audit inflation.
- [ ] Computational/scientific evidence and conclusions remain distinguishable; facts, inferences, unknowns, and unexecuted proposals are explicit; existing fairness/approval and ACRe/comparison rules remain.
- [ ] Propose and record bounded implementation children before executing a multipart design; do not silently narrow the author intent.

## Plan

Imagine/design early with the real advisor, not self-certification. Send the
bounded decomposition to the parent before implementation. New intent or
unresolved scope judgment returns to the author; routine implementation within
the recorded intent proceeds. No estimates, pipelines, subjective probabilities,
paid API calls, publication authority, or generic scientific certification.

## Verification and feasibility

Documentation/scenario audit with positive and boundary controls; no wording
pins or scientific estimates. Current skill/reference paths exist, no foreign
read/edit or paid route required. Finish combined Imagine/Blind-Spot before
implementation; use distinct semantic adherence, gaze, gate, eligible merge,
and roar. No implementation has begun.
